\bigskip
\noindent\textbf{Test binaries} --- test runner and conformance tests
(assembled separately; linked into \texttt{tmp/test\_kcc}):

\medskip
\noindent\textbf{test\_runner.s} --- test harness entry point:

@o tmp/tests/test_runner.s @{
@<ARM64: common macros@>
@<Test: runner entry@>
@<Test: assert helpers@>
@<Test: runner data@>
@}

\noindent\textbf{test\_lexer.s} --- lexer conformance tests:

@o tmp/tests/test_lexer.s @{
